     To fix this, I need to ensure atomicity for the stock check and decrement operation. I will introduce a lock mechanism within the `Inventory` class to protect the `_stock` attribute[0m[2m. This will ensure that only one `checkout` operation can modify the stock at a time, preventing overselling.
     
